WEBVTT

00:47:29.625 --> 00:47:31.018
my first impulse was to say,

00:47:31.042 --> 00:47:33.976
"Well, why does it have to be
either or, can it be both ends?"

00:47:34.000 --> 00:47:36.809
And then I thought,
"OK, I've internalized your worldview."

00:47:36.833 --> 00:47:37.934
(Laughter)

00:47:37.958 --> 00:47:40.059
But in all seriousness --
EP: But it's true.

00:47:40.083 --> 00:47:43.226
AG: Why does it have to be either or?
Can I be raised to be both?

00:47:43.250 --> 00:47:46.393
EP: I don't think it's either or,
but I think that when you ask --

00:47:46.417 --> 00:47:48.643
How many of you would say
that you were raised,

00:47:48.667 --> 00:47:50.999
raised -- that doesn't mean
you stayed this way,

00:47:51.023 --> 00:47:52.893
it doesn't mean
that you didn't have to

00:47:52.917 --> 00:47:55.101
because there was
nobody there for you, right?

00:47:55.125 --> 00:47:57.184
It's not always just
a nice messages story.

00:47:57.208 --> 00:47:59.726
How many of you would say
the focus was on autonomy,

00:47:59.750 --> 00:48:01.768
on self-reliance?